\#{ The starting volume.yaml, made once and never written over. Context:
   parts (folder names). Not LaTeX: everything printed must be plain. }
# The volume: its title and its parts, in order. `python -m coding
# build-chapters` made this file once and never changes it: edit it by hand,
# then rebuild, and main.tex follows. A part is `intro` (the introduction)
# or a language's Glottocode (its chapter, built from its annotation).
title: Untitled volume
parts:
\BLOCK{for p in parts}
  - \VAR{p}
\BLOCK{endfor}
